<section id="how" class="how-section">
  <!-- Curved connector SVG removed per request -->
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">How Prova works</p>
      <h2>One quick moment can change the whole scroll.</h2>
      <p class="muted">Instead of just detecting misinformation, Prova helps people slow down, understand what they’re seeing, and protect the people around them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-shell">
      <div class="flow-card flow-card-left">
        <span class="flow-badge">01</span>
        <h3>Pause</h3>
        <p>When a post feels off, Prova nudges you to stop for a second before the share.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-center">
        <div class="flow-glow"></div>
        <div class="flow-screen">
          <div class="flow-pill">Is this source credible?</div>
          <div class="flow-pill subtle">Bias • context • evidence</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-card flow-card-right">
        <span class="flow-badge">02</span>
        <h3>Prove</h3>
        <p>Instant AI context shows whether the claim, image, or video looks trustworthy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-foot">
      <div class="flow-footer-card">
        <span class="flow-badge">03</span>
        <h3>Protect</h3>
        <p>With that clarity, you can share with more care and help your community avoid blind consumption.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
